BT 1 0 0 1 0 93.1 Tm /F1 8.6 Tf 11.3 TL 1.029214 Tw (Two features tie the list together. The methods left the record clean \227 sleeplessness, cold,) Tj T* 0 Tw .613309 Tw (thirst, and psychological terror produce a compliant signature and no photographable wound,) Tj T* 0 Tw .346743 Tw (which is why they dominated over crude beating. And they were combinatorial: any one might) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.098614 Tw (be resisted, but layered together and run without a time limit they defeated ordinary endurance,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.515117 Tw (which was the entire design. The confession, once signed, was self-authenticating \227 it) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.109112 Tw (\223proved\224 the very conspiracy it had been extracted to confirm, and could be used in turn to) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.425467 Tw (name and break the next person. The elasticity of Article 58 and the machinery of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.506514 Tw (interrogation were the same instrument seen from two ends: a charge broad enough to fit) Tj T* 0 Tw (anyone, and a process reliable enough to make anyone confess to it.) Tj T* ET
